# One test of harness/Sem.idr's table, the one the runner names as this
# script's second argument: harness/Main.idr runs this directory once per
# entry of Sem.names, as semantics@<name>. Its two programs, one with every
# operand written in it and one that reads every operand from its stdin,
# and the value each case must give, are the runner's, computed from what
# each primitive means (sem_case, harness/lib/e2e.sh): the compiler's
# folder answers the first, its code the second.
. "$IDRIS_MLIR_ROOT/harness/testutils.sh"
sem_case "$parameter"
